    .. math::
        \ell(x, y) = L = \{l_1, ..., l_N\}^T

    with

    .. math::
        l_n = \begin{cases}
        0.5 (x_n - y_n)^2 / beta, & \text{if } |x_n - y_n| < beta \\
        |x_n - y_n| - 0.5 * beta, & \text{otherwise }
        \end{cases}

    If `reduction` is not `none`, then:

    .. math::
        \ell(x, y) =
        \begin{cases}
            \operatorname{mean}(L), &  \text{if reduction} = \text{`mean';}\\
            \operatorname{sum}(L),  &  \text{if reduction} = \text{`sum'.}
